  "lore": {
    "description": "A four-legged creature resembling a seahorse, crested and spined along its neck and back, with a long trunk-like snout and a tightly curled tail. Hippochamps were designed as emergency response crews for the electrical and chemical fires that occur on Poseidas's hydro-processing rigs, and as a means of defense against pirates seeking to steal valuable Algael. The snout serves as a high-pressure water cannon that maintains a steady stream, hosing down fires and threats alike. It patrols the hydro-processing fleets, rig upon rig in interlocking nets of floating industrial zones trawling a global ocean for algae.",
